domain CharacterSemanticMigrationSuccessorPlanV1Acceptance:
  description "Record owner acceptance of the exact recommended successor plan without authorizing its separately gated external effects."

problem P1:
  |
    The owner reviewed the complete Japanese translation of successor plan
    revision 1 and instructed that the recommended route proceed.

evidence E_PLAN:
  |
    docs/character-semantic-migration-successor-plan-v1.md is the sealed exact
    English plan candidate. It recommends two coordinated lanes, rejection of
    Proposed ADR-0029 revision 1, a new successor ADR package, local A1 before
    provider or deployment work, and distinct B1-B14 authority gates.

evidence E_REVIEW:
  |
    docs/evidence/character-semantic-migration-successor-plan-v1-owner-review-ja.md
    is the sealed complete Japanese review translation presented with overview,
    differences, decision points, alternatives, risks, and unknowns.

evidence OWNER_ACCEPTANCE:
  |
    On 2026-09-10, after that review presentation, the product owner replied:
    推奨で進めてください。

premise SCOPE:
  |
    The instruction accepts the recommended plan and authorizes local plan
    integration, A1 local correction closeout, and B1 proposed ADR authoring. It
    does not accept the future ADR package or authorize provider use, deployment,
    production reads or writes, policy activation, or candidate acceptance.

pending U1:
  |
    Every effect explicitly reserved in plan A2, A3, B2, and B8-B14 retains its
    own evidence and owner-decision boundary.

decision D1 based_on P1, E_PLAN, E_REVIEW, OWNER_ACCEPTANCE, SCOPE, U1:
  |
    Preserve the sealed plan bytes and record exact plan acceptance separately.
    Integrate its task dependencies into planning artifacts, execute A1 locally,
    and author B1 as Proposed while retaining all later gates.
